      "content": "That's a good start and it definitely hits the professional notes. \n\nThe thing is, the client is a bit nervous about how this will land. They're worried it might come across a bit too \"dry\" or robotic, which might make them seem uncaring. \n\nCould you try a second version? Try to infuse it with a bit more warmth and a more positive, uplifting outlook for the future of the hotel so they feel like we're truly dedicated to excellence. Just keep an eye on that positivity score—too high and it's fake, but we want to see those numbers move up a bit from the first draft. Try to make it feel more \"heartfelt\" without losing the professionalism.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
